IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SMOOTHQUANT-W8A8.

DATA DIVISION.
01 DIMENSION           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 ALPHA-PCT           PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 MAX-OUTLIER-X10     PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 IS-SAFE             PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SMOOTHQUANT.
    IF DIMENSION == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF ALPHA-PCT == 0
        MOVE 50 TO ALPHA-PCT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 1 TO IS-SAFE.
    IF MAX-OUTLIER-X10 >= 150
        MOVE 0 TO IS-SAFE.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 IS-SAFE.
    WEIGHT 30 MAX-OUTLIER-X10.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
